		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Wither is less a creature and more a calamity given form, a floating tangle of skulls and black energy that rots the land as it drifts. We’ve seen its handiwork: craters, twisted trees, and a sky choked with ash where once there was sunlight. Its projectiles don’t just wound, they linger, gnawing at life and hope alike. If we summon it, there will be no turning back; we’ll either stand together long enough to bring it down, or leave behind another scar on the world."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "72EA62835F4AEFD9"
			rewards: [
