		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4We arrived to the sound of bells and screams, pillager banners flapping crimson over fields trampled by ravagers. Crossbow bolts thudded into walls as iron golems roared and threw raiders into the air like rag dolls. Fighting in the cramped streets, dodging panicked villagers and stray arrows, felt more like chaos than heroism. But when the last horn blew and the survivors came out with gifts and shy smiles, it felt like, for once, we’d actually made the world a little better."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "443D68F7812B0BD5"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 64
					id: "0041E1AB27ABAB8A"
