		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Bonescaller stands in graveyards like a shepherd, staff tapping softly as skeletons claw their way from the dirt at his command. He doesn’t shout or rage; he murmurs, and the dead obey. We saw him once at a distance, silhouettes rising behind him like a forest of bone, each skull turning in perfect unison. Killing him won’t just be a matter of steel, it will mean wading through his pale congregation while he tears at our courage with whispered curses."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "4D814D7620E3E98E"
			rewards: [
