		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4We first heard the chittering long before we saw her, a slow, echoing sound that seemed to crawl under our skin. The Mother of Spider sits at the heart of her nest like a bloated jewel, surrounded by webs so thick they muffle sound and swallow light. When she moves, the whole cavern shifts with her, and lesser spiders spill from the ceiling like black rain. If we face her, we’ll need fire and sharp blades, and nerves steady enough not to bolt when the eggs start hatching."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: "born_in_chaos_v1:spider_mandible"
