		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4On quiet nights, we hear them: low, rumbling howls that roll across the hills, answered by dozens more. The Dire Hound Leader is bigger than any wolf we’ve seen, its eyes burning with a cruel intelligence as it drives the pack like a general on a battlefield. Alone, one hound is trouble; together, under their leader’s command, they’re an army that tears through armor and flesh alike. If we want a chance, we’ll have to separate the leader from the pack, or become bones picked clean under the moon."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: "born_in_chaos_v1:gnawed_bones"
