				value: 12000
			}]
			title: "Twelve Thousand Damage"
			x: 1.0d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The rogue mages travel like walking natural disasters, each one wrapped in their chosen element. We saw the Air Mage riding storms, the Water Mage walking on rivers, the Earth Mage striding through stone, and the Fire Mage leaving glassed sand where grass once grew. Alone, each is a nightmare; together, they turn the battlefield into a puzzle of shifting hazards. To defeat them, we’ll need to break their unity, pull one away, then another—before their combined power grinds us to dust."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "3D40D1DB3CD9B0C6"
