		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Celestial Monolith looms like a fallen star, a towering shard of otherworldly stone etched with constellations that move when you’re not looking. Around it drift the Traversers, figures that blink in and out of existence, stepping between spaces as easily as we step between blocks. They guard the Monolith like zealots, warping close to strike and vanishing before blades can touch them. Bringing down that star-fracture will mean reading its strange patterns while we survive the guardians flitting through the gaps in reality."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
