		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4We thought we knew evokers—smug little tyrants hiding behind fangs and fanged spirits—until we heard of the Archevoker. This one commands entire storms of vexes and conjures fanged maws that span whole streets, not just doorways. When he raises his hands, the ground itself sprouts hostile shapes, biting and tearing at anything that moves. To defeat him, we’ll have to close the distance while the world around us tries to chew us apart."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "4D6BF7479CE74699"
