		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Ancient Knight stands watch where the world has forgotten the reason for the watch in the first place. Moss creeps over his armor, and yet every movement he makes is crisp, practiced, and utterly relentless. He doesn’t taunt or rage; he simply tests us, blow after blow, as if measuring us against some old, impossible standard. If we can best him, it won’t feel like a victory over evil—more like earning the respect of a guardian who was never meant to yield."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "7CDFBC158801FAF9"
