		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Dead King rules a kingdom of dust and silence, seated on a throne of cracked stone and rusted crowns. His armor is ancient, but death has made him patient and terribly strong; every blow he takes rings like a funeral bell. Around him, ghostly knights repeat their last charges, spectral lines of cavalry breaking and reforming in endless loops. To end his reign, we’ll have to break the pattern—shatter the ritual of his unlife and topple the throne that keeps him from rest."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "0C0E8CD401D8DF87"
