		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Necromancer treats death like a resource, not an ending. He decorates his lairs with bones not out of vanity, but convenience, like tools for his next spell. Unlike the Bonescallers, he delights in experimentation, stitching together horrors from mismatched parts and giving them grotesque new purpose. Taking him down will mean fighting through creations that should not exist, all while he laughs and carves new sigils into the air with every heartbeat."]
