		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Echo of Tyros isn’t truly alive; it’s a memory made manifest, a lingering afterimage of some great champion or tyrant. Its form flickers, half-solid, half-light, attacks phasing through walls and sometimes through us. When it speaks, its voice overlaps itself, as if we’re hearing every version of Tyros across time at once. To silence the Echo, we’ll have to unravel the story it’s trapped in, striking not just at its body but at the pattern that keeps recalling it to the world."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
