		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Masked Hunter is a horrible beast that appears to be a somewhat recent arrival to this land, and quite frankly, we’d all be better off without them. If you’re near the forest, they’ll make themselves known with their ear-piercing screech, but don’t take them for simple creatures. They’re crafty and sadistic, staying out of sight and setting up traps in order to ensnare and torment any being unfortunate enough to be spotted by them. In addition to their long claws, they also employ poisoned knives in order to whittle down their prey. Be on your guard when pursuing them."]
