			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: [
				"A lonely tower perched where sea meets stone, its lantern long cold and its staircases echo with distant cries. Something stalks within the shadows of its spiraling halls, drawn to the distant chime of ocean winds. To claim the light again, we must face the depths below and the foes that whisper in the dark."
