			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: [
				"We came upon the goods before we heard the rustle of feet in the grass. Crates and barrels lie scattered, some still bearing the promise of trade, but watchful eyes follow every step. The silence here is crafted — and waiting to be broken. Only those who think fast and strike faster will leave with coin in hand."
