		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: [
				"A vessel of cloud and timber drifts where sky meets storm, its decks silent but for the creak of timbers and distant thunder. Up here, wind-borne threats circle with otherworldly grace, and treasure glints between the rafters. To conquer the Challenger, we must be born of the wind and master of its fury."
