			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: [
				"A bastion of talons and thunderous cries suspended between sky and ruin, the Aviary holds creatures unlike any found on solid ground. Wings charged with crackling energy beat in furious arcs, and every perch may conceal ruin or reward. Only the most prepared dares step onto these roosting heights."
