		{
			description: [
				"Adventurer Guilds are common throughout the world, giving out quests to both adventurers and bounty hunters alike, providing tasks with rewards ranging from abysmal to incredible. Bounty boards can commonly be found around in villages. Ever since the advent of the Endless Night, it seems that the number and prominence of adventurer guilds have declined substantially, being found within other buildings and with even worse rewards than before."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"I have collected the notes of a hunter recently, who has documented both his latest bounties and holidays."
				""
				"I am unaware of what happened to this hunter. It seems his party left in a hurry in an attack and left behind some of their belongings, such as a journal with scattered notes and scrambled writings. I don't think they have perished yet, but I haven't seen them anywhere."
			]
